# Opt-in, read-only Python package index hosts. Appended to filter.anthropic via
# the proxy image's EXTRA_FILTER build arg; never merged into a base filter and
# off by default. Executor-side split deployments only — the single-container
# posture holds Discord tokens and Claude credentials together, which is exactly
# the pairing that bounds the residual risk here.
#
# Deliberately excluded, do not add:
#   registry.npmjs.org      publish endpoint is the same host — reachable means writable
#   upload.pypi.org         PyPI's upload endpoint; the split from pypi.org is why
#                           the two hosts below are eligible at all
#   github.com / codeload   source dependencies are out of scope
^pypi\.org$
^files\.pythonhosted\.org$
